sequenceDiagram
    participant Maya as Maya Chen<br/>CX Program Lead
    participant CLI as CXOS CLI<br/>cox (node dist)
    participant Engine as Coxswain Engine<br/>Qwen3 8B/32B
    participant Registry as Pack Registry<br/>detectPack()
    participant Retail as Retail Pack<br/>5 journeys
    participant Artifacts as Artifacts<br/>6 files
    participant Local as Local<br/>offline
    participant AWS as AWS<br/>plan-only CFN
    participant Board as Board / Fleet<br/>4→5 specs
    participant Govern as Govern<br/>CAB / Dashboard

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx doctor --offline
    CLI->>Engine: load_config → force_offline
    Engine-->>CLI: runtime mode=offline, wiring artifacts=offline<br/>ontology ok 223 nodes
    CLI-->>Maya: ✓ node >=20, ✓ config parses

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx board
    CLI->>Board: list_specs → load_each → rollup
    Board-->>CLI: specs=4 deployed=3 (core retail, fin-core, health-core)
    CLI-->>Maya: board + path: list_specs → ...

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx catalog --pack default
    CLI->>Engine: resolveOntologyPack(default)
    Engine-->>CLI: 40 intents (billing, technical, account...)
    CLI-->>Maya: catalog 9 domains, 40 intents

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx run holiday-returns-2026<br/>"Holiday returns surge 3x Dec-Jan..."
    CLI->>Registry: detectPack(idea)
    Registry->>Retail: score retail 0.85 > telco 0.12 → retail
    Retail->>Artifacts: seedRetailDesignPack(spec, ontology)
    Artifacts->>Artifacts: 5 journeys: returns_refunds, loyalty_program,<br/>store_pickup, online_order_support, retention
    Artifacts->>Local: merge_design → deploy local (3 artifacts)
    Local->>AWS: deploy aws (4 artifacts, template.yaml plan-only)
    AWS-->>CLI: deployments=artifacts,local,aws all healthy
    CLI->>Board: status_all → artifacts:healthy → local:healthy → aws:healthy
    Board-->>Maya: ok=true, summary score:100, path: create_spec → ... → emit<br/>next: console, apply, board, brief, cab-export

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx status holiday-returns-2026
    CLI->>Board: load_workspace → status_all
    Board-->>CLI: phases R=a D=a T=m, requirements:2, journeys:5
    CLI-->>Maya: status + path

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx brief holiday-returns-2026
    CLI->>Govern: renderExecBrief(workspace)
    Govern-->>CLI: BRIEF.md (executive markdown, no model)
    CLI-->>Maya: brief

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx board
    CLI->>Board: list_specs (now 5 specs)
    Board-->>Maya: specs=5 deployed=4 (core, fin-core, health-core, holiday-returns-2026)

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx queue
    CLI->>Board: buildWorkQueue (proposals+tasks, sort urgency)
    Board-->>Maya: proposals_open=0 tasks_open=0

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx journeys --pack default
    CLI->>Registry: listJourneys(default)
    Registry-->>CLI: 7 journeys (billing_dispute 6 stages, etc.)
    CLI-->>Maya: journeys

    Maya->>CLI: pnpm cox cx operate holiday-returns-2026
    CLI->>Engine: console tick → poll_status → route:none (healthy)
    Engine->>Board: propose gated (no new proposals, healthy)
    Board-->>CLI: prop_open=0, path: load_strong → poll_status → emit
    CLI-->>Maya: (no new proposals) board line

    Maya->>Govern: pnpm cox cx cab-export holiday-returns-2026
    Govern->>AWS: copy_aws (template.yaml, APPLY.md) + proposals/tasks/BRIEF
    Govern-->>CLI: CAB package ./cx-cab-holiday (8 files)
    CLI-->>Maya: out: /Users/.../cx-cab-holiday

    Maya->>Govern: pnpm cox cx dashboard ./cxos-dashboard-holiday.html
    Govern->>Board: board → queue → render_html
    Govern-->>CLI: wrote 4.6K dashboard
    CLI-->>Maya: dashboard ready

    Maya->>Board: pnpm cox cx board (final)
    Board-->>Maya: specs=5 deployed=4, holiday-returns-2026 healthy<br/>Scenario complete
